This project is developed to create a shape generator using Python.

The system allows users to select different shapes through user input.

Users can choose from square, rectangle, pyramid, circle, and triangle.

The program allows users to enter the side length of a square to generate the shape.

Users can enter the length and breadth to generate a rectangle.

The pyramid and triangle are generated based on the height entered by the user.

The circle is generated based on the radius specified by the user.

The program uses mathematical calculations to generate the circular pattern.

The selected shape is printed using asterisks based on the dimensions provided.

This project helps in understanding Python loops, conditional statements, nested loops, mathematical operations, and user input.
